            <div xml:id="d608">

                <pb facs="0632" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg622"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/2–249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-02-05T17:00:00-05:00">February 5, 1949—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>66. Rptd Shanghai 204, Nanking 181. ECA agrees recommendation final para Contel
                    167 Feb 2 subject Lapham’s approval. Dept concurs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
